{"seq":3,"slug":"ab-testing-retention","title":"A/B 测试与留存","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-economy-balancing/tuning/ab-testing-retention","wordCount":1772,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"a-b-测试与留存\">A/B 测试与留存</h1><p>「新版掉率上线后留存涨了 2%，是这次改动的功劳吗？」——这句话里藏着数据分析最大的陷阱。同期可能还上了新活动、出了新角色、甚至只是周末。要把「这次改动的真实因果效应」从一堆混杂因素里干净地剥离出来，唯一可靠的工具是对照实验。本篇专讲 A/B 测试的设计、统计判定与留存度量。它是 <a href=\"data-driven-tuning\">数据驱动调优</a> 闭环里「严格因果」的那一环，校验的是前面所有篇章的设计假设——数值改动到底有没有让玩家玩得更久、付得更多。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>A/B 测试的逻辑核心是「随机对照」：把玩家随机分成实验组（用新数值）与对照组（用旧数值），其它一切相同。因为分组随机，两组的混杂因素（活动、节假日、玩家构成）在统计上相互抵消，组间差异就能归因于唯一的变量——你改的那个数值。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[提出假设&lt;br/&gt;改X会提升留存] --&gt; B[随机分组]&#10;  B --&gt; C[对照组 A&lt;br/&gt;旧数值]&#10;  B --&gt; D[实验组 B&lt;br/&gt;新数值]&#10;  C --&gt; E[采集指标&lt;br/&gt;留存/付费/时长]&#10;  D --&gt; E&#10;  E --&gt; F[统计检验&lt;br/&gt;差异显著?]&#10;  F --&gt;|显著且正向| G[全量上线]&#10;  F --&gt;|不显著| H[样本不足或无效]&#10;  F --&gt;|显著且负向| I[放弃/回滚]&#10;  H --&gt; J[加大样本或放弃]\">flowchart TD\n  A[提出假设&lt;br/&gt;改X会提升留存] --&gt; B[随机分组]\n  B --&gt; C[对照组 A&lt;br/&gt;旧数值]\n  B --&gt; D[实验组 B&lt;br/&gt;新数值]\n  C --&gt; E[采集指标&lt;br/&gt;留存/付费/时长]\n  D --&gt; E\n  E --&gt; F[统计检验&lt;br/&gt;差异显著?]\n  F --&gt;|显著且正向| G[全量上线]\n  F --&gt;|不显著| H[样本不足或无效]\n  F --&gt;|显著且负向| I[放弃/回滚]\n  H --&gt; J[加大样本或放弃]</pre><p>下表给出 A/B 测试常用的核心评估指标：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>次留/7留/30留</td>\n<td>第 N 日仍登录的玩家比例</td>\n<td>衡量长期粘性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>付费率</td>\n<td>付费玩家占比</td>\n<td>商业化健康</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ARPU/ARPPU</td>\n<td>人均/付费人均收入</td>\n<td>收入效率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>会话时长/频次</td>\n<td>单次/单日游玩量</td>\n<td>参与深度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>关键漏斗转化</td>\n<td>通过某节点的比例</td>\n<td>定位卡点</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"随机分组的纪律\">随机分组的纪律</h2><p>A/B 测试的所有可信度都建立在「分组真随机且无污染」之上，这一步出错则全盘皆错。常见的污染来源：分组按账号 ID 末位（若 ID 分配有规律则不随机）、实验组玩家能看到对照组（社交泄露，比如公会里有人有新功能有人没有）、组间样本量悬殊。</p>\n<p>上线真实验前应先做「A/A 测试」——把两组都给旧数值，理论上指标应无显著差异。如果 A/A 都测出了「显著差异」，说明分组或统计流程本身有 bug，必须先修好再做 A/B。这是验证实验框架可信度的标准前置步骤，跳过它就可能把系统偏差误读成改动效果。分组单位也要选对：影响个人的数值（如个人掉率）按玩家分组，影响对局的数值（如平衡）可能要按对局或服务器分组，否则实验组玩家和对照组玩家在同一局里互相干扰。</p>\n<h2 id=\"显著性-别被噪声骗了\">显著性：别被噪声骗了</h2><p>实验组次留 41%、对照组 40%，能说新数值更好吗？不一定——这 1% 可能纯属随机波动。判断差异是否「真实」而非噪声，要做统计显著性检验。对留存这类比例指标，常用两比例 Z 检验，检验统计量为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>B</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>A</mi></msub></mrow><msqrt><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>A</mi></msub></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>B</mi></msub></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msqrt></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z = \\frac{\\hat{p}_B - \\hat{p}_A}{\\sqrt{\\hat{p}(1-\\hat{p})\\left(\\frac{1}{n_A}+\\frac{1}{n_B}\\right)}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.7014em;vertical-align:-2.33em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.11em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.535em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.535em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-4.4em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.4em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:1em;\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3567em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1433em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4453em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3567em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1433em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4453em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.495em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.4em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:1.02em;height:2.48em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"2.48em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 2592\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M424,2478\nc-1.3,-0.7,-38.5,-172,-111.5,-514c-73,-342,-109.8,-513.3,-110.5,-514\nc0,-2,-10.7,14.3,-32,49c-4.7,7.3,-9.8,15.7,-15.5,25c-5.7,9.3,-9.8,16,-12.5,20\ns-5,7,-5,7c-4,-3.3,-8.3,-7.7,-13,-13s-13,-13,-13,-13s76,-122,76,-122s77,-121,77,-121\ns209,968,209,968c0,-2,84.7,-361.7,254,-1079c169.3,-717.3,254.7,-1077.7,256,-1081\nl0 -0c4,-6.7,10,-10,18,-10 H400000\nv40H1014.6\ns-87.3,378.7,-272.6,1166c-185.3,787.3,-279.3,1182.3,-282,1185\nc-2,6,-10,9,-24,9\nc-8,0,-12,-0.7,-12,-2z M1001 80\nh400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.905em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.765em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.535em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.212em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.535em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.33em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>A</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>B</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{p}_A, \\hat{p}_B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是两组留存率、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{p}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是合并留存率、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 是各组样本量。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|z|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span> 越大、差异越可信，通常 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1.96</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|z|&gt;1.96</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.96</span></span></span></span></span> 对应 95% 置信（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0.05</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p&lt;0.05</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.05</span></span></span></span></span>）才算显著。关键洞察藏在分母里：样本量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 越小，分母越大、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span></span> 越小——所以小样本几乎测不出小差异。</p>\n<p>这引出 A/B 测试最重要的纪律：开测前必须算「所需样本量」。要可靠检出的效应越小，需要的样本越大。检出 5% 的留存提升可能几千人就够，检出 0.5% 的提升可能需要数十万人。样本不够就下结论，等于掷硬币。下表示意效应大小与所需样本量的关系（80% 检验功效、95% 置信的量级感）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>期望检出的留存提升</th>\n<th>每组所需样本量（量级）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>5 个百分点</td>\n<td>数百到数千</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1 个百分点</td>\n<td>数万</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>0.5 个百分点</td>\n<td>数十万</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"留存的度量与解读\">留存的度量与解读</h2><p>留存是几乎所有数值改动的终极裁判，因为它直接关联长期收入与游戏生命力。但留存指标要会读。次日留存反映新手体验（教学、首段节奏是否顺滑，关联 <a href=\"../economy/economic-loops\">游戏内经济循环</a> 的引擎循环转速），7 日留存反映中期内容厚度，30 日留存反映长期目标与社交粘性。一次数值改动可能提升次留却伤害长留（比如前期放水留住新人但破坏了长期养成节奏），所以不能只看单一留存数。</p>\n<p>解读还要警惕「指标打架」与「新奇效应」。新内容上线初期数据普遍偏好（玩家图新鲜），需观察足够长时间待新奇效应消退后再判断。多个指标矛盾时（留存升但付费降），要回到设计意图权衡，而非机械追单一数字——这也是为什么数值调优最终是「带价值判断的工程」，纯靠数据无法替设计师做取舍。</p>\n<h2 id=\"实验文化与长期主义\">实验文化与长期主义</h2><p>把 A/B 测试真正用好，靠的是团队的实验文化而非单次实验技巧。健康的文化包括：每个重要数值改动默认走实验而非凭直觉拍板；接受「大部分实验是负向或无效的」这一事实（这恰恰证明实验在挡住坏改动）；以及不为追求短期指标而牺牲长期体验——一个能拉高 7 日付费却伤害 30 日留存的改动，长期看是亏的。</p>\n<p>实验也有伦理与信任边界。对玩家做实验时，不应用实验做明显伤害体验的「黑暗模式」试探（比如故意调高某组的付费墙看反应），这既有合规风险也透支信任。最稳健的长期策略，是让数据服务于「把游戏做得更好玩、经济更健康」这个真目标，而非短期榨取——这与本 hub 从数值基础到经济平衡一以贯之的立场相同：可持续的乐趣，才是所有数值与经济设计的终点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>A/B 测试靠「随机对照」剥离因果：随机分组让混杂因素相互抵消，组间差异才能归因于唯一改动的数值。</li>\n<li>可信度建立在真随机、无污染分组上；上线前做 A/A 测试验证框架，分组单位要匹配改动影响范围。</li>\n<li>用统计显著性检验区分真实差异与噪声（如两比例 Z 检验 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1.96</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|z|&gt;1.96</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.96</span></span></span></span></span>），开测前必须按期望效应大小预算样本量。</li>\n<li>留存分次留/7留/30留各反映不同阶段，须警惕「提次留伤长留」「新奇效应」与指标打架，回到设计意图权衡。</li>\n<li>用好 A/B 靠实验文化：重要改动默认实验、接受多数实验无效、坚持长期主义、守住不伤害玩家信任的伦理边界。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"A/B 测试与留存","id":"a-b-测试与留存"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"随机分组的纪律","id":"随机分组的纪律"},{"level":2,"text":"显著性：别被噪声骗了","id":"显著性-别被噪声骗了"},{"level":2,"text":"留存的度量与解读","id":"留存的度量与解读"},{"level":2,"text":"实验文化与长期主义","id":"实验文化与长期主义"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"数据驱动调优","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-economy-balancing/tuning/data-driven-tuning"},"next":null}